## Capacitor vs nativo

| Aspecto | Capacitor | React Native / Flutter |
|---------|-----------|------------------------|
| Carpeta | `frontend/` + `android/` / `ios/` | `mobile/` (convención) |
| UI | DevExtreme + CSS responsive | Componentes nativos / librería UI |
| Config API | Pantalla config + `@capacitor/preferences` | Pantalla config + secure storage |
| Consultas | Vista kardex (List/cards DX) | FlatList / ListView kardex |
| Spec detallada | `01-especificacion-capacitor.md` | `02-especificacion-react-native-flutter.md` |

Backend **único**; envelope y auth sin cambios.

